Description: Report the live paired-headset owner through the edition failure engine
 Keep the OpenXR result unchanged and the first runtime undisturbed.
 Store the peer process and English reason in the person-scoped problem;
 clear it when a later runtime successfully acquires the headset.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos
Forwarded: not-needed, local paired headset provider

